Package: SCOPEinR
Type: Package
Title: SCOPE Model v(2.1) in R
Version: 0.46
Authors@R: person(given = "Carlos",
           family = "Camino",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "carlos.caminogonzalez@wur.nl",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5188-4406"))
Maintainer: Carlos Camino <carlos.caminogonzalez@wur.nl>
Description: An R implementation of the SCOPE (Soil Canopy Observation,
    Photochemistry and Energy fluxes) model v2.1, coupling radiative
    transfer (via ToolsRTM leaf/canopy models) with a full canopy energy
    balance to simulate reflectance, fluorescence, radiance, and energy
    fluxes.
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: lhs, ToolsRTM, progress, signal, expint, doParallel, parallel, foreach, data.table, stats, pracma, lubridate, rlang, tidyr, ggplot2, dplyr, utils, grDevices
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
